+intLikeTotal	48	Int maps to itself and Bool maps false/true to 0/1, matching its two frozen defining rules on their complete domain; negative and positive Int plus both Bool cases evaluated.	PASS
+«intOf(_)_MPY-BUILTINS_Int_Val»	50-54	Matches supplied builtins.k rules intOf(I)=I and intOf(B)=if B then 1 else 0; negative/positive Int and both Bool cases evaluated. The off-domain branch is outside every operational rule and target guard.	PASS
