+«project:Float»	73-74	Extracts the Float injection on the defined domain. The default is only an off-domain total completion; Float extraction was evaluated at 1.5.	PASS
+«project:Int»	76-77	Extracts the Int injection on the defined domain. Negative Int extraction was evaluated; a coordinated-constant counterfactual shows why this value was checked independently.	PASS
+projectBoolTotal	79-82	Returns the exact Bool payload on the only frozen guarded use domain. Its off-domain total completion is not selected by the rule guard.	PASS
+projectFloatTotal	84-87	Returns the exact Float payload on the frozen floatV domain; checked against project:Float at 1.5.	PASS
+projectIntTotal	89-92	Returns the exact Int payload on the frozen exclusive-Int domain; checked against project:Int at -7 and 42.	PASS
+«project:Bool?»	94-95	Exact optional Bool projection: some payload on singleton Bool and none on other/non-value computations.	PASS
+«project:Float?»	97-98	Exact optional Float projection: some payload on singleton Float and none on other/non-value computations.	PASS
